{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":24907,\"title\":\"Satan's Schoolgirls\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Parochial school takes a dark and lusty turn for Father Thomas (J. Scott Green), a well-meaning Sunday school teacher who embarks on what he believes will be a quiet summer assignment at a rural academy for girls. It's hard enough for the Father to deal with four sex-hungry students let alone the school's devilish secret.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/diYGelUZsSiFtMEUZpPq12ctsY1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":3.4,\"voteCount\":7,\"year\":2004,\"runtime\":68,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Romance\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Ted W. Crestview\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":550470,\"name\":\"Ted W. Crestview\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":92812,\"name\":\"J. Scott Green\",\"character\":\"Father Thomas\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":92813,\"name\":\"Suzi Lorraine\",\"character\":\"Sister Helen\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/boBZQ40n5sXvbVs4JAo9mzAYkSN.jpg\"},{\"id\":92814,\"name\":\"Kerri Taylor\",\"character\":\"Tammy\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2lugX0B2295b5XFCsrS2FRWXlJs.jpg\"},{\"id\":92815,\"name\":\"Jane Scarlett\",\"character\":\"Julian (as Jane Scarlett)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/maNDDEbcZOtkYLOaWhu6ON9vprH.jpg\"},{\"id\":92816,\"name\":\"Shannon Moore\",\"character\":\"Karen\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":92817,\"name\":\"Brandy D'Vinn\",\"character\":\"Lily\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":92818,\"name\":\"Terry Shane\",\"character\":\"Father Wells\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":99706,\"name\":\"T.J. Glenn\",\"character\":\"Lawnboy\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":58431,\"title\":\"Pride and Prejudice and Zombies\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jsJlOhVHiz1xXr36616EI8tJ4b2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zrDODDwUG8Yen9JDbWcE0ACH5aT.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A zombie outbreak has fallen upon the land in this reimagining of Jane Austen's classic tale of the tangled relationships between lovers from different social classes in 19th century England. Feisty heroine Elizabeth Bennet is a master of martial arts and weaponry and the handsome Mr. Darcy is a fierce zombie killer, yet the epitome of upper class prejudice. As the zombie outbreak intensifies, they must swallow their pride and join forces on the blood-soaked battlefield in order to conquer the undead once and for all.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Horror\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":20616,\"title\":\"Swimfan\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mOAiqOivdVecMu0yhumN6pzDWmo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/asYdN1eS7zvkEJVIQaYqQcqssj6.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ben Cronin has it all: the admiration of his many friends, a terrific girlfriend, and he's on the fast-track to an athletic scholarship. Ben's rock-solid, promising future and romance are turned upside-down with the arrival of Madison Bell. Madison, the new girl in town, quickly sets her sights on the impressionable Ben. While their first few meetings are innocent enough, the obsessive and seductive Madison wants more ... much more.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":316154,\"title\":\"The Bad Batch\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7o14VaMphEIzPwzeW6FP3A6zb4W.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aQ06MnEDLh9X3ZOtY21UD2XB197.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After being exiled to a fenced-off wasteland, Arlen is kidnapped by a group of cannibals and goes on a journey to reunite a missing girl with her father.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9616,\"title\":\"The Order\"